he running price, and a casino in the back office with slots, roulette, blackjack and horse races.The catch is the SEC. The faster your empire prints money, and the more insider tips you take, the higher the meter climbs. When it fills, In","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694917","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4738620-1842212951312231","game_id":"steam-4738620","kind":"update","title":"Update 2.4.6: the soundtrack starts on its own","summary":"A curator wrote yesterday that there was no music in the game, even though the page advertises a soundtrack. He was right.The file was there, but the function that plays it was called from exactly one place: the button in the top bar. At startup that button showed a muted icon, in grey. A player who did not notice it played in silence from start to finish.In 2.4.6 the soundtrack starts at launch. If you turned the music off in the settings, your choice is respected and nothing starts.The button ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T05:36:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951312231","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4738620-1842212951309468","game_id":"steam-4738620","kind":"update","title":"Update 2.4.5: readability","summary":"A player reported that the game launched at a microscopic scale on his 4K screen, and that the text was not only tiny but also too low in contrast to read. Both points were correct, and both were measurable.Interface size. The whole layout was written in fixed pixels for a 1600x900 screen. On a 4K display it therefore kept its physical size and used about a fifth of the screen. The game now works out a scale factor at startup from the window size: x2.4 at 3840x2160, x1.6 at 1440p, x1.2 at 1080p.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T08:14:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4738620-1842212951309338","game_id":"steam-4738620","kind":"update","title":"Update 2.4.4: the localization is fixed","summary":"A curator pointed out that parts of the game were still showing in French no matter which language you picked. They were right, and the cause ran deeper than a few forgotten strings.The game was choosing its language too late at startup. On every launch, the news ticker, the career title, the quest list and the portfolio were drawn before the language was applied. They came up in French for everyone, then corrected themselves a few seconds later.What changed in 2.4.4:The language is now selected","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T07:28:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309338","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4738620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4738620":"2026-10-26T14:05:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4738620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:34Z"},"4921200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":